<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-4949] Incorrect behavior CacheJdbcPojoStore if binary marshaller enable</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4949</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In case using binary marshaller, CacheJdbcPojoStore.loadCache may not provide binary object in callback.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://apache-ignite-developers.2346864.n4.nabble.com/CachePojoStore-data-loading-with-binary-marshaller-td16417.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;dev-list&lt;/a&gt; discussion.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
