                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="15969893" author="vkulichenko" created="Sat, 15 Apr 2017 09:55:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=DmitriyGovorukhin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;DmitriyGovorukhin&quot;&gt;DmitriyGovorukhin&lt;/a&gt;, is there a pull request that I can take a look at?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15969899" author="dmitriygovorukhin" created="Sat, 15 Apr 2017 10:07:21 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vkulichenko&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vkulichenko&quot;&gt;vkulichenko&lt;/a&gt; Done, please look &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/1803&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;pull/1803&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15969904" author="vkulichenko" created="Sat, 15 Apr 2017 10:33:48 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=DmitriyGovorukhin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;DmitriyGovorukhin&quot;&gt;DmitriyGovorukhin&lt;/a&gt;, it looks like this change makes sure that binary mapping comes first, which makes sense. But why do we still need the second mapping?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=kuaw26&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;kuaw26&quot;&gt;kuaw26&lt;/a&gt;, I think you should take a look at this as well, because you know implementation details of the POJO store much better.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15970937" author="kuaw26" created="Mon, 17 Apr 2017 10:24:48 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/1803&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/1803&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Looks good for me.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15970942" author="dmitriygovorukhin" created="Mon, 17 Apr 2017 10:28:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vkulichenko&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vkulichenko&quot;&gt;vkulichenko&lt;/a&gt; What do you think? I corrected the comments, take a look at the new changes.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15974875" author="vkulichenko" created="Wed, 19 Apr 2017 15:04:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=DmitriyGovorukhin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;DmitriyGovorukhin&quot;&gt;DmitriyGovorukhin&lt;/a&gt;, couple of minor comments:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The exception in case of class doesn&apos;t exist should be more informative, suggesting possible solutions (deploy the class or use binary marshaller).&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Condition &lt;tt&gt;if (!binarySupported &amp;amp;&amp;amp; keyKind == TypeKind.BINARY)&lt;/tt&gt; should never be true now, so let&apos;s replace it with assertion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Other than that looks good, assuming that all tests pass.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15974910" author="dmitriygovorukhin" created="Wed, 19 Apr 2017 15:28:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vkulichenko&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vkulichenko&quot;&gt;vkulichenko&lt;/a&gt; Done, please check pull request now.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15975090" author="vkulichenko" created="Wed, 19 Apr 2017 17:03:21 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good to me. Can be merged if tests are OK.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15978733" author="agoncharuk" created="Fri, 21 Apr 2017 13:29:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to ignite-2.0&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
